{
  "file_id": "ID03593",
  "text_count": 50,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "B-but... okay, then, it's time for\nthe last Love Question!",
      "_offset": 3,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "What's our favorite food?",
      "_offset": 62,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Ummmm...",
      "_offset": 88,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Tree leaves",
      "_offset": 97,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Salt",
      "_offset": 109,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Poop",
      "_offset": 114,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "A-amazing! Correct! Absolutely\ncorrect!",
      "_offset": 141,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Where on earth did you learn\nthat!? That's top-secret\ninformation!",
      "_offset": 181,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Ahaha...",
      "_offset": 248,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "(I actually just picked an answer\nI thought made sense, but I can't\nsay that out loud...)",
      "_offset": 257,
      "_length": 89,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "All right! That's all the\nquestions I'll ask you on this\ndate!",
      "_offset": 347,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Please look forward to the\nresults!",
      "_offset": 410,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Horrible! Do you really think we\nlike that stuff? I thought that\nwas obvious!",
      "_offset": 468,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Well, I thought since you Digimon\nalways hang out in unusual\nplaces...",
      "_offset": 546,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Yeah, maybe! But we hate salt!",
      "_offset": 617,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Aaah, so I was wrong...",
      "_offset": 648,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "All right! That's all the\nquestions I'll ask you on this\ndate!",
      "_offset": 672,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Please look forward to the\nresults!",
      "_offset": 735,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Mimi, did you *seriously* just say\nthat?",
      "_offset": 793,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "I thought it made sense?",
      "_offset": 834,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Rude! Really rude! How could you\nthink that?!",
      "_offset": 859,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "We like poop, but we don't eat it!\nWe like it, but we don't eat it!",
      "_offset": 905,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Stop! Is this how you act in front\nof a lady?",
      "_offset": 973,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "...Ahem.",
      "_offset": 1023,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Anyway!\nThat's all the questions I'll be\nasking you on this date!",
      "_offset": 1032,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Please look forward to the\nresults!",
      "_offset": 1098,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "You seem to know everything about\nus so far.",
      "_offset": 1134,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "It's proof we really *are*\ncompatible!",
      "_offset": 1179,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Ugh, why is he saying this...",
      "_offset": 1218,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "I'm surprised, too.",
      "_offset": 1248,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "My love! Mimi! Here, take this!",
      "_offset": 1268,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "It's kinda sticky, but thank you,\nI appreciate it.",
      "_offset": 1300,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Are we truly compatible?",
      "_offset": 1351,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "What's with the upwards glance?",
      "_offset": 1376,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Patience, Mimi!",
      "_offset": 1408,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "All right, Mimi, here! This is for\nyou!",
      "_offset": 1424,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Thank you, I'll take it.",
      "_offset": 1464,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Doesn't look like I have a lot of\ncompatibility with Mimi...",
      "_offset": 1489,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Well, Mimi's totally out of your\nleague.",
      "_offset": 1550,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Maybe...",
      "_offset": 1591,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Does our love end here?",
      "_offset": 1600,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Well, there are other fish in the\nsea...",
      "_offset": 1624,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "So, where's the cola you promised\nme?",
      "_offset": 1665,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "I had fun today! Here's the\npromised cola!",
      "_offset": 1703,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Yaaaaaay! I'll have some right\nnow!",
      "_offset": 1746,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Please wait. This cola seems to be\nexpired...",
      "_offset": 1782,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "What?! Ah, it's all syrupy inside.\nEw, it's gross!",
      "_offset": 1828,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Expired? Isn't syrupy cola\nsupposed to be the best?",
      "_offset": 1879,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Heh, if you can drink that...",
      "_offset": 1931,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "I *really* shouldn't have gone on\nthat date...",
      "_offset": 1961,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}